    "text": "Adam lifede nigonhund geara and XXX geara.\nNoe lifede \u00e6r \u00f0am flode syx hund geara and \u00e6fter \u00f0am flode \u00f0ryo hund wintra and fiftig wintra, and he\nSeo earc w\u00e6s \u00f0ryo hund f\u00e6\u00f0ma lang and fiftig f\u00e6\u00f0ma wid, and \u00f0ryttig f\u00e6\u00f0ma heah.\nAnd his sunu Sem lifede syx hund geara, and \u00f0ryo and \u00f0ryttig geara.\nHis sunu hatte Arfaxad, se lifode feower hund geara and eahta and \u00f0ryttig geara.\n\u00d0a gestrynde he sunu se hatte heber, of him asprang \u00fe\u00e6t hebreisc folc.",
